{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:00 2026-09-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>前日（9月4日）是「靚靚」袁詠儀的55歲生日。日前她在微博貼上慶祝相片，引人注目的莫過於一束由「魔童」張慕童（Morton）親自挑選並送上的精美鮮花。袁詠儀捧著鮮花展現幸福笑容，並甜蜜發文寫道：「今年生日收到最漂亮的一束花」，字裡行間滿是對兒子溫馨孝心的驕傲與感動。</p>\n<h2>好友的祝賀同樣充滿心思</h2>\n<p>好友的祝賀同樣充滿心思，蔡一智太太雪芳深知袁詠儀對愛馬仕（Hermès）的鍾愛，特意送上一款極具創意的經典橙色禮盒造型蛋糕，上面不僅飾有可愛的小手袋與小白馬，巧克力牌上更親切地寫著「生日快樂姨媽」。</p>\n<img alt=\"張慕童跟袁詠儀是餅印母子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba3a2d3debb9a86381dea7fb3792f863/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_13_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童自小已長得很俊俏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5613453371bf37b24597080aa68caf9/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_12_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童樣貌似足袁詠儀拍《金枝玉葉》時。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4837626287e5a87c67a0f4c28477538/2024-04/403.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童帥氣十足。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f54a4b90dcf2d866d7430986d13673cd/2024-12/FF2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀55歲生日收「最美鮮花」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/540f99c87ce5c891d4678e21b3e7761b/2026-09/001_1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"好友的祝賀同樣充滿心思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60d8e7598ee91cc557ba370312f71901/2026-09/002_1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖早前在廣州舉行一連兩場演唱會。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6242b972cffe2a796cbdf154a7b4a47d/2026-08/cheung_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀的19歲兒子「魔童」張慕童登上爸爸張智霖的演唱會舞台。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5279d008e69dfcb6e3a4ef078a78c261/2026-08/cheung_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"19歲的魔童一身全黑型格打扮，台風穩健得令人驚艷。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f79cf9dcf691d149dd310da7d66a27f/2026-08/cheung_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"魔童遺傳父母的精緻五官，星味十足。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb40b02c248adc054c4ed7681327954e/2026-08/cheung_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖媽媽換上兒子演唱會的黑Tee支持。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef4b1b34b9f4ace504bcc93d2ec5f67b/2026-08/01_3_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童去年6月中學畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26c8519a4bcaf3a39604c34eb156aacb/2025-06/VS-----0_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童樣貌似足袁詠儀拍《金枝玉葉》時。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3460180c1a44c891c4ffff98ba3008a4/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_9_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童貼童年相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9196064e997fce7c6a593e232eda1a15/2025-09/MR01_mp4_snapshot_00_05_393.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童留學生活疑曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce01af551b5034fb5ffc2c3efdbdba8f/2025-09/MR03_mp4_snapshot_00_00_396.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童早前罕晒正面樣撞樣「金城安」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60ebd53bf75ffe3c600ba5ce40357891/2025-09/MR05.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童與友人夾BAND。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69fbb983595a68990875b943f8d2cebb/2025-09/MR06_mp4_snapshot_00_00_566.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童做幕後。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/655902a1a7abe3aecccbe04d6ce6a82c/2025-09/MR07_mp4_snapshot_00_02_631.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童愛打機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/477efbbfeefd1e288b815b958b31c911/2025-09/MR09.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"小時候的張慕童，可愛又靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2acdf61f09195639789f28299988b6e3/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_17_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"12歲的張慕童。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45bfe372c00086e5cffafa5fdf900d58/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_14_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童越大越靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0027dcebbc6829d89f2ae38ff095143d/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_6_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童越大越靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95b0e41353b067c58f5bb9bbeaca04b0/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_5_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童樣貌似足袁詠儀拍《金枝玉葉》時。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc2ba7697cba8b4b7c2c4fab26f361e9/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_18_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖和袁詠儀不時晒家庭照晒幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c914786056ba1de5100705e79a9d727d/2022-11/jBQ58XvjwrFIZDHO7jVPb2-C4xNhhfnlLh3IXi4dyF4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"連帶兒子一舉一動都受網民關注。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e1940d55399740c81fd4d58b01ba106/2022-11/TQb_e9EOdZSd8MHeKTy0aCLDEqmtMWl0WrmpVFq5qVQ.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童高大又靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee8cab47318b9fd4790fc5d0ed919558/2024-04/201.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童對音樂有興趣，還會彈結他。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/090b92a5d06917dffde00045d2d5969c/2024-04/204_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀保護兒子張慕童，未有公開囝囝的樣貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1df6c4bec1a13060c030896ae9c0b90/2024-09/ANITA_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童17歲時已經高過媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a9affbe19ac8c65ea4084ecce8ce70/2022-11/VaIZnx5BBOUab5knDdVWJiOvmBLWHCCtQ3jMnUN4zJ0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童不時於社交平台分享生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/829da7e00995db223ff9426163264cc0/2022-11/X12rQd_FtoZ1J5b-gklC3eraJQ7hHAJNXxyQKl8ckCo.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童長大後甚少公開正面樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c56cbce29df7c567027b594d8e4fc22/2022-11/unknown_315235046_494207929418283_2119369577857343169_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童也是一名貓奴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50b6a7c4411b5afd76c1333c11c9015d/2024-04/209.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張慕童從出生以來都是外界焦點</h2>\n<p>袁詠儀與張智霖的兒子張慕童從出生以來都是外界焦點，不過張慕童對幕前做演員的興趣不大，反而有意向幕後發展。早前張智霖在廣州展開一連兩場巡迴演唱會上，張慕童竟登上爸爸的舞台，擔任結他手，罕有在約萬名觀眾面前表演，當時他表現得相當沉穩，專注地彈奏著電結他，成為全場焦點。張慕童的演出照片在網上瘋傳，不少網民大讚袁詠儀的兒子盡得父母優良基因，五官精緻立體，完美結合父母的優點，散發出獨特的帥氣，是不折不扣的「星二代」型男。</p>\n<h2>袁詠儀的「虎媽」形象深入民心</h2>\n<p>袁詠儀的「虎媽」形象深入民心，她曾經因為「一言堂」與兒子關係很差，甚至出現抗拒，結果兒子曾向張智霖提出要求「換過一個媽咪」，更因為高壓管治把兒子逼出情緒病。經過醫生診斷，袁詠儀終明白是自己問題，只因她太自我中心，給予兒子太大壓力，繼而影響張慕童的行為及情緒。結果袁詠儀聽從醫生建議努力修補關係，學懂聆聽兒子的想法，早前更首次公開向兒子道歉：「我對我個仔係幾唔公平，因為佢爹哋媽咪係張智霖同袁詠儀，變咗好多時佢所做嘅嘢同講嘅嘢都會畀人放大，不過食得鹹魚抵得渴，我成日同個仔講，冇辦法喇，媽咪對你唔住，可能因為我哋嘅原因，而令到佢失去咗一啲自由。」袁詠儀更笑言此生最自豪的作品就是兒子張慕童。</p>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀與張智霖投資有道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7231da41f8936f4ea54609260ae689e1/2024-02/Image_1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀除了愛買物業，也愛買藝術品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d4e1f98cda1e955def41fbb591ca63f/2024-02/Image_2_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與袁詠儀多物業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c242aef73f9b7099738eff36234edc61/2022-11/KRFn7H4W6RNe3vAx4wcz4FQglJ_xFFIP_Bvec_wb3nM.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2017年，張智霖便以破當時屋苑紀錄的9,180萬港元，購入東半山傳統豪宅區大寶閣的一個高層單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fccf6621ee1e6e1e28c2fb374ce80dd/2022-11/vEiQdqXs8BS3fU_4_LN24bUYuXV1goLvZ7U0zme1NM4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀與張智霖2023年以公司名義，斥資880萬置入柴灣工業城2期一個高層單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/351565b23cdff70c1993ce0e93eb8048/2023-09/2__12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀與老公張智霖是圈中出名的模範夫妻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed9c230d4dcff50f52b917a3901a4004/2026-04/001_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀應街拍攝影師的邀請即席拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f691ef1c98f2d1c461dd0043a3510c3d/2026-04/002_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀看似簡約的穿搭價值不菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98cdc3c263b7dd22fc239481eeec07b8/2026-04/003_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀拎着逾6位數的Hermès 「Birkin à l'envers」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d7fd856455ecd5979e7eb023d8e1b2e/2026-04/004_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀在整個拍攝過程超級親民友善。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf717a36ba9fefb728d634b52bdf6a27/2026-04/005.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"對於一身的打扮，袁詠儀笑說：「其實自己舒服就得。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14b3984d6c543903c93d3251b73a7cb9/2026-04/006_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀經常拎Hermès 出巡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05f6ae8485101a2dfdfe9e0814d0a653/2026-04/007_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀圈中著名的Hermès粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5949388b9808d2dcb720efb8aae6c882/2026-04/008_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"市場消息也指張智霖持有一間價值逾億元的豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1d78f262acc29e02418c0fd2e5e6747/2023-02/YUENLENG_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀在小紅書上分享了一張與張智霖的親密自拍，曝光家中環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28726b0c8379acdad0116b45a2acf230/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-09_at_3_19_57_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前袁詠儀分享愛犬在家中木地板上玩耍的可愛影片，讓粉絲得以一窺她舒適寬敞的家居環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3eec119bac96d8dd88103102fd830ff4/2026-01/1_11_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與袁詠儀每年新年都會布置豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d25ca64b90b89aad64bf9994772d905/2026-01/001Okobogy1hmg8vcvv0gj62bc334npe02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與袁詠儀豪宅有不少木製擺設，連相框都是木製。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f22c06cdc85e703771aeb07cc291918/2026-01/001Okobogy1hvjuh67uvtj62dc35sx6p02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與袁詠儀豪宅內擺放了很多家庭照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02c5bf3d54679bf6bcbcd8a7d7406d1a/2026-01/001Okobogy1hvjuh7z28tj62dc35s4qq02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀曾分享兒子出門照，不過有指現時他們已搬離此單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1469b931a2d314c7fed253f1642f1363/2026-01/anitayuenwy_1600994100_2405635332034136460_1898387.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曾經有傳老公張智霖累積送逾2000萬元的手袋給老婆。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6b6430738fca69675ab07ee631838eb/2022-11/Qvf7NSDvHiyNVlGojzkSS_3thZY4hmo5LLVXiCy1V4g.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀是Hermès擁躉，圖中的Birkin Bag二手價約 $200,000。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5562bf8fca7d4ac62970d7c14bb9105/2024-01/w1200_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指袁詠儀家中的收藏包包，有如珍藏館一樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc529425e5e1c343c8d4069151295777/2024-01/62eead82jw1e9lbp5g213j20hs0dcgn7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀的手袋款式包羅萬有。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/481f121de67e143111975adf66c64630/2024-01/62eead82jw1e928llq86cj20hs0dcgo2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀飾物都用Hermès。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24aa69c6ad9fb3d4a0ad23423733e9e8/2024-01/62eead82jw1ebm0efyik3j20ci0fuq47.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀近年開始會用比較低調的包包。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f149adc61fcf9bf7f1dea706e7a56fe/2024-01/62eead82ly1fjmlh9rv3rj21z1340e87.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Hermès Toolbox 是類似牛奶盒的袋款。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaddc2d64fab2edcfd14213e9f16476f/2024-01/20221116175928_2231.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀行藝術展，被網民認出主因是身上炒價逾30萬元的手袋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2b02ccc09fabb83570b174eda2ae052/2023-03/YUEN%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民曾在外地的Hermès專門店捕獲張智霖夫婦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/134bbf0aa120418ef49d0f7fbdb37c3c/2023-07/CHILAM_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀曾被網民捕獲時，身上所穿的藍白恤衫是Hermès出品，售價逾2萬元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bdedf4a843e070a5805a42700cb4486/2023-05/YUENWINGYEE_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀的泳衣亦是Hermès。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40cf9f5102725e4b39b62257faf690d5/2022-11/7aVO4oP6wKr7hky7WLF_IlP6gjSRormOnXCC1p1wgtY.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀戴上舊版Daytona 6263，炒價由150萬至400多萬不等。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f581adc49dddc572a47a33c30ce4c166/2024-01/yuen_2__0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T12:19:18.227005+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":804,"images":65,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}